            }
          ],
          "title": "Introduction",
          "slug": "introduction",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4322,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<span class=\"handwriting\" style=\"font-size:2em\">Take time to practice and master this technique.</span>",
              "legacyComponentId": 6581,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "exerciseAccordion",
              "sections": [
                {
                  "title": "Knit and measure an accurate swatch",
                  "bodyHtml": "No matter what you want to knit, <b>knitting a gauge swatch is NOT OPTIONAL!</b><br>Without knowing gauge:<ul>\r\n\t<li>How do you know how much yarn you need?</li>\r\n\t<li>How are you going to know if the finished item will fit?</li>\r\n\t<li>Determine if you are even going to LIKE the resulting fabric</li>\r\n\t<li>Try out the chosen stitch pattern, maybe it's too tedious... learn this BEFORE starting to knit</li>\r\n\t<li>Dress the swatch and check for shrinkage, pilling, fading</li>\r\n\t<li>Save time by knowing AHEAD if the yarn will knit easily</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n\t<img src=\"/path/images/87/measure_rows.jpg\">\r\n\t<img src=\"/path/images/87/measure_stitches.jpg\">\r\n",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow1.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Build the Knit it Now Practice Pattern",
                  "bodyHtml": " <i class=\"fa fa-question-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <a data-vimeoid=\"402313052\" class=\"videopopup\"> Are you new to Knit it Now Patterns? </a><br><a href=\"/knit/DynamicPattern/679/practice-necklines\"><img width=\"500\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/pattern.jpg\"></a>",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow2.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Knit and block the front and back pieces",
                  "bodyHtml": "I've scrapped off the center front stitches (you can bind them off, or hold them with a stitch holder).<br>\r\nI've also scrapped off the shoulders.<br><img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/front and back.jpg\">",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow3.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Join the shoulder(s)",
                  "bodyHtml": "<style>\r\n\t.container-border {\r\n\t\tborder: 1px solid #ccc;\r\n\t\tborder-radius: 15px;\r\n\t\tpadding-top: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-right: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-bottom: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-left: 20px;\r\n\t}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\t<div class=\"container-border\"><b>Option1: Knit the band in 2 pieces</b>\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Seam the right shoulder (as worn)</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>#1 Knit a band piece for the back and right side of the V</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>#2 Knit a second band piece for the left side of the V</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Join the left shoulder and neatly seam the band</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/band1.jpg\">\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"container-border\"><b>Option2: Knit the band in one piece</b>\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Join both shoulders</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Calculate and knit the band in one piece for the entire neck opening</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Join the band to the garment in sections:\r\n\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Join the band over as many stitches as possible and bind off</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Repeat joining and binding off in sections until the entire band is joined to the neck opening</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/band2.jpg\">\r\n\r\n\t</div>\r\n",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow4.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Measure and Calculate",
                  "bodyHtml": "<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/measure11.jpg\">\r\n\t<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/measure21.jpg\">",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow5.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Knit the band(s)",
                  "bodyHtml": "<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/band.jpg\">",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow6.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Hang the garment edge",
                  "bodyHtml": "Right side facing\r\n\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/hang1.jpg\">\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/hang2.jpg\">\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/hang3.jpg\">\r\n",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow7.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Re-hang the band from scrap",
                  "bodyHtml": "<ol>\r\n<li>Push the neck edge behind the latches</li>\r\n<li>Position the band stitches in the hooks of the needles</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/hang4.jpg\">",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow8.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Attach the band to the neck edge",
                  "bodyHtml": "<ol>\r\n\t<li>Pull the band stitches through the garment edge</li>\r\n\t<li>Bind off LOOSELY</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n\t\r\n\t\t <div class=\"subvideopopup\" data-videotitle=\"attach_band\" data-vimeoid=\"586457429\">\r\n\t\t<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/1213385709-698e628544231623efc61750bb2f9b93317c65aa2822f3a238e98a5ae42c5b45-d_1280x720?r=pad\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"imagecenter text-center\"><button class=\"btn btn-sm\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play fa-2x learn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div>\t\t\r\n</div>\r\n",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow9.png"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Overlap the band at the center front and secure the band to the open stitches at the bottom of the V",
                  "bodyHtml": "<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/overlap1.jpg\"><br><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/overlap.jpg\">",
                  "iconSrc": "/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow10.png"
                }
              ],
              "legacy": {
                "showText": "below",
                "size": null
              },
              "legacyComponentId": 6558,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
