            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<script>\r\nfunction PrintElem()\r\n\t\t{\r\n                   $('.notesinfo').show();\r\n\t\t    var mywindow = window.open('', 'PRINT', 'height=500,width=800');\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t    mywindow.document.write('<html><head><title>Rectangle | Square Tool</title>');\r\n\t\t    mywindow.document.write('</head><body >');\r\n\t\t    mywindow.document.write('<h1>Check List</h1>');\r\n\t\t    mywindow.document.write(document.getElementById('printable').innerHTML);\r\n\t\t    mywindow.document.write('</body></html>');\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t    mywindow.document.close(); // necessary for IE >= 10\r\n\t\t    mywindow.focus(); // necessary for IE >= 10*/\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t    mywindow.print();\r\n\t\t    //mywindow.close();\r\n\t\t    return true;\r\n\t\t}\r\n</SCRIPT>\t\t\r\n<button onclick=\"PrintElem()\">print</button>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div id=\"printable\">\r\n<span class=\"handwriting\" style=\"font-size:2em\">Crossover V Checklist</span>\r\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\r\n\t<table class=\"table\">\r\n\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t<thead>\r\n\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<th></th>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<th></th>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<th></th>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<th style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\">Notes</th>\r\n\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t</thead>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow1.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Knit and Measure an ACCURATE SWATCH</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Swatching is NOT Optional. <br>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li> How will you know how many stitches you need for your band? </li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li> You need to know your gauge to create your custom practice pattern\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</em>\r\n\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow2.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Build your Knit it Now practice Pattern with YOUR gauge</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Use pieces 9 and 10 in the pattern for this Knit-Along</em></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"><img src=\"/images/blank.gif\" width=\"150px\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow3.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Knit and block the front and back pieces</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Feeling adventurous? Knit in a stitch pattern and practice<br> starting and stopping the stitch pattern to knit  the necklines </em></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow4.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Join the shoulder(s)</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Decision time. Are you knitting the band in one piece or 2?</em></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow5.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Measure and calculate your band instructions</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Don't forget to add seaming stitches</em></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow6.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Knit the bands and scrap off</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Knit in ribbing - try 1x1 or 2x2 .. try adding a stripe.</em></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow7.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Hang the garment edge</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Right side (knit side) facing- push the knitting behind the latches</em></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow8.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Rehang the ribbed bands</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Be sure to pick up EVERY stitch from the waste yarn</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Put the stitches in the hooks of the needles</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</em>\r\n\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow9.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Attach the band</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Close the latches</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Pull the band stitches through the garment edge</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Bind off LOOSELY</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</em>\r\n\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/arrow10.png\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td>Overlap the bands at the center front<br> and secure the center front garment stitches</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><em>Right over left for the ladies, left over right for the guys</em></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td style=\"display:none\" class=\"notesinfo\"></td>\r\n\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\r\n\t\t</tbody>\r\n\t</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n",
