      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "My sample neckband is far from perfect <i class=\"fa fa-smile-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><br>Before I tackle that gorgeous (and expensive) wool silk yarn for my next sweater, I'm going to try again.<br><b>Here are the critical points to focus on.</b><mark>Click the dots</mark><br>",
