          "title": "Critical Points",
          "slug": "critical-points",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4338,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "\r\nDepending on the cast on method you choose, there may be a right and wrong side to the cast on edge. Since the cast on edge of the neck band is so visible, take time to determine which side looks best.\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/compare_ribbing.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6574,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "hidden: right/wrong",
          "slug": "hidden-right-wrong",
          "order": 2,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4339,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "When you position your ribbing at the center front opening, you'll want to plan what stitch will be along the seamed edge. <Br>\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/needle_arrangment.png\">",
              "legacyComponentId": 6575,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "hidden: needle arrangement",
          "slug": "hidden-needle-arrangement",
          "order": 3,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4340,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Although the video focuses on raglan shaping, get inspired to add decorative decreases to your V-neck.",
              "legacyComponentId": 6576,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151859783",
              "title": null,
              "legacyComponentId": 6577,
              "order": 2
            }
          ],
          "title": "hidden: decorative decreases",
          "slug": "hidden-decorative-decreases",
          "order": 4,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4341,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<style>\r\n\t.container-border {\r\n\t\tborder: 1px solid #ccc;\r\n\t\tborder-radius: 15px;\r\n\t\tpadding-top: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-right: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-bottom: 20px;\r\n\t\tpadding-left: 20px;\r\n\t}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\t<div class=\"container-border\"><b>Option1: Knit the band in 2 pieces</b>\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Seam the right shoulder (as worn)</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>#1 Knit a band piece for the back and right side of the V</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>#2 Knit a second band piece for the left side of the V</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Join the left shoulder and neatly seam the band</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/band1.jpg\">\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<div class=\"container-border\"><b>Option2: Knit the band in one piece</b>\r\n\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Join both shoulders</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Calculate and knit the band in one piece for the entire neck opening</li>\r\n\t\t\t<li>Join the band to the garment in sections:\r\n\t\t\t\t<ul>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Join the band over as many stitches as possible and bind off</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Repeat joining and binding off in sections until the entire band is joined to the neck opening</li>\r\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/band2.jpg\">\r\n\r\n\t</div>\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6578,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "hidden: 1 or 2 pieces?",
          "slug": "hidden-1-or-2-pieces",
          "order": 5,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4342,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Single Bed Inspiration",
      "slug": "single-bed-inspiration",
      "displayOrder": 4,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 551,
        "lessonOrder": 4
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Your bands don't have to be knit in ribbing.<br>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Purl side facing, pick up the garment edge</li>\r\n<li>At garment tension knit for 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Tighten tension and knit 4-6 rows (for the rolled edge)</li>\r\n<li>Bind off loosely</li>\r\n<li>Don't forget <a data-GlossaryId='605' class='glossaryhelp'>Seaming Stitches <i class='fa fa-question-circle' aria-hidden='true'></i></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\t<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/89/rolled.jpg\">\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 6584,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Stockinette Option",
          "slug": "stockinette-option",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 4347,
            "blockType": "HTML"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Stuff you should know",
      "slug": "stuff-you-should-know",
      "displayOrder": 5,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 548,
        "lessonOrder": 5
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
